Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for local Pages Functions testing.
Use real local-only values in `.dev.vars`; never commit that file.

Required local keys:
- ADMIN_PASSWORD
- AUTH_SECRET
- OPENAI_API_KEY
- OPENAI_MODEL
- SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL
- SENDGRID_FROM_NAME
- SENDGRID_REPLY_TO_EMAIL
- SENDGRID_REPLY_TO_NAME
- SENDGRID_CC_EMAILS
- DAILY_SEND_LIMIT

Optional local key:
- SENDGRID_API_KEY
